          "# Databricks vs Snowflake Funding History\n",
          "\n",
          "This demo notebook creates a small dataset with the funding history of **Databricks** and **Snowflake**.  \n",
          "We will apply a simple transformation to calculate the **cumulative funding raised over time** for each company."
